00:01:03.909 --> 00:01:08.630
As we know from the millions of cases of corona
virus that we've now seen, sometimes you'll

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:12.240
have this five to seven day period and you'll
be feeling better, and then later you'll be

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:13.240
